# Model artifacts live on the server, never in git.
#
# These are produced by retrain (retrain.py) and are environment-specific.
# Committing them once shipped a stale NSL-KDD model that bricked detection
# when restored over the live one — see ../README.md ("History: the mixup").
# Keep the directory, ignore everything in it.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
